# Shemá — ETEN (BE-11 · OBT-400)
#
# The credit report for one ETEN fiscal year and its manual ledger. `year` is the fiscal year
# that ENDS on 31 July of that number: `?year=2026` covers 01/08/2025 to 31/07/2026.
#
# Three things to know before running anything below:
#   * every report answered is recorded in `shema_eten_reports` (deduplicated: an unchanged
#     report is not recorded twice) — `reportId` in the answer names the row;
#   * a project in a sensitive country comes back with `country: {withheld: true,
#     regionLabelKey}` for every role, and still counts in the totals;
#   * with nothing listed in ETEN — the state of the 127 migrated records — the report is
#     empty on purpose. Nothing is seeded.
#
# Before running: seed the app and its roles, grant one, and give the account a region.
#   uv run python scripts/seed_apps_roles.py
#   uv run python scripts/grant_app_role.py coord.local@test.com shema coordinator
# Only `globalStrategist` and `coordinator` (or a platform admin) may set a manual credit.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@accessToken = {{shema_login.response.body.tokens.access_token}}

### Login — named, so every request below reuses the token
# @name shema_login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coord.local@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### The report for the fiscal year that closed on 31/07/2026
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/eten/report?year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### The manual ledger, for the projects the caller reaches
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/eten/credits
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Set a manual figure — it wins over the calculated one, and names who set it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/shema/eten/credits/guarani-mbya/2026
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credits": 1
}
